      "value": "After few hours since I wrote this canny (about 18 hours since I pushed Generate Imposters first time), I received an notification that imposter for the avatar successfully generated.\n\nIn addition, While I'm sleeping, I received two more notification about imposter for the avatar (one that successful and one that failed).",
