      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hi. Thanks for the report.\n\nIf I understand you correctly, you did not see the Impostors checkmarks appear, and the \"Generate Impostors\" button changed back to active. \n\nI looked into the history of your avatar. It seems that we successfully created impostors for your avatar several times.\n\n- Impostors were successfully created on November 22nd at 8:47pm JST\n\n- Then, a second time, impostors were successfully created on November 30th at 5:07am JST. \n\n- There was a third time later, where it failed, but you still had impostors from the previous time so it was okay.\n\nWhat web browser do you use? Was this on desktop or a mobile device? Did you just have the web page open, and did not see any changes? Did you try reloading the web page? \n\nI'm not completely sure what happened here. At the time we were trying various things to accelerate the processing of impostors and there were some unforeseen errors where the jobs succeeded but were not properly notified. But you still should have seen the web page change, so that's strange to me.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
