      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{609975bd064a4627d50fdf8b|full_name}: \n\n> If I understand you correctly, you did not see the Impostors checkmarks appear, and the \"Generate Impostors\" button changed back to active. \n\nI think your understanding is not correct.\n\nI did not see \"Generating Impostors\" and the the \"Generate Impostors\" button changed back to active.\n\nThe time I wrote this canny is before first Imposter generation (before 8:47pm JST on November 22nd) so I think not seeing the Impostors checkmarks is correct.\n\nAfter 8:47pm JST on November 22nd, I can see Impostors checkmarks.\n\n \n\n> * Impostors were successfully created on November 22nd at 8:47pm JST\n\n> * Then, a second time, impostors were successfully created on November 30th at 5:07am JST.\n\n> * There was a third time later, where it failed, but you still had impostors from the previous time so it was okay.\n\nI think second time is on November 23th but this is almost same as I think.\n\n> What web browser do you use? Was this on desktop or a mobile device?\n\nI tried firefiox on macOS, on Windows 11, on iPad, and on iPhone.\n\n> Did you just have the web page open, and did not see any changes? Did you try reloading the web page? \n\nOf course I tried reloading and not reloading the webpage.\n\nI kept one tab showing the avatar page but after several hours, \"Generating Impostors\" disappeard.",
